    "answer": { "kind": "expression", "content": "$S_5=25$", "final": "$S_5=25$" },
    "solution": "解析：由 $a_4=a_1+3d=7$ 得 $d=2$。\n\n于是 $S_5=5a_1+\\dfrac{5\\times 4}{2}d=5+20=25$。\n\n$$S_5=\\dfrac{5(a_1+a_5)}{2}=25$$",
